--TEST--
cms_head_tags() needs the render context, whose channel and locale the tags are for
--TEMPLATE--
{{ cms_head_tags(entry).title }}
--DATA--
return ['entry' => $this->pageWith(['en_US' => ['title' => 'About us', 'slug' => 'about-us']])]
--EXCEPTION--
Twig\Error\RuntimeError: An exception has been thrown during the rendering of a template ("The head tags can only be printed from a template that has the render context in "_cms_render_context", such as a layout template") in "index.twig" at line 2.
